{
  "name": "Instagram-Studio — Postagem (Metricool)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Postagem — agenda no Metricool\n\nA cada 30 min chama `POST /publish` no serviço. Ele lê o `cronograma.json` da Fase 2, agenda cada post no Metricool (legenda sua + mídia editada) e devolve o resumo.\n\n**Pré-requisitos:**\n1. Plano do Metricool com **API** (pegue o `userToken` em Configurações → API) e o `blogId`/`userId` da marca.\n2. Instagram conectado como **Business/Creator** no Metricool (para auto-publicar).\n3. A mídia precisa de **URL pública**: defina `metricool.publicBaseUrl` + `STUDIO_MEDIA_TOKEN` (o serviço serve `/media`), ou coloque `media-url.txt` em cada post.\n4. Variáveis no serviço: `METRICOOL_USER_TOKEN`, `METRICOOL_USER_ID`, `METRICOOL_BLOG_ID`.\n\nSem token, `/publish` roda em **dry-run** (mostra o payload, não envia).",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "note1",
      "name": "Leia-me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [120, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 30 }] }
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "A cada 30 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [160, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:4599/publish",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "x-studio-token", "value": "COLE_SEU_STUDIO_TOKEN" }]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http",
      "name": "studio /publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [420, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-count",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "iff",
      "name": "Tem o que agendar?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "voce@exemplo.com",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.summary }}",
        "options": { "appendAttribution": false }
      },
      "id": "gmail",
      "name": "Gmail: resultado do agendamento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [940, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "noop",
      "name": "Nada a agendar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [940, 540]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "A cada 30 min": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "studio /publish", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "studio /publish": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Tem o que agendar?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Tem o que agendar?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Gmail: resultado do agendamento", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Nada a agendar", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {}
}
